    "details": "In `GCCBootstrap_jll` `9.4.0+0`, the affected target artifact is `aarch64-linux-gnu` (AArch64 Linux with glibc), which ships Binutils 2.29.1. The other target artifacts ship Binutils 2.38 and are outside the affected upstream range.\n\nA memory consumption issue in `get_data` function in `binutils/nm.c` in GNU nm before 2.34 allows attackers to cause a denial of service via crafted command.",
